## Frontend environment variables (Vite)
#
# Copy to `frontend/.env` to customize local development.
#
# Backend API base URL used by the dev-server proxy in `vite.config.js`.
# If port 5000 is already in use on your machine, run the backend on another
# port (e.g. `PORT=5001`) and set this accordingly.
VITE_BACKEND_URL=http://localhost:5000

